OL,3,CKendal Calling festival kicks off with
OL,4,C40,000 people expected
OL,6,FThe Kendal Calling festival has kicked
OL,7,Foff today, with excited festival-goers
OL,8,Fsetting up camp and preparing to see
OL,9,Fsome of the biggest names in indie
OL,10,Fmusic.
OL,12,FNow in its 21st year, 40,000 people
OL,13,Fare expected to attend the event at
OL,14,FLowther Deer Park - just 900 people
OL,15,Fattended the first Kendal Calling back
OL,16,Fin 2006.
OL,18,FThis year the headliners include fan
OL,19,Ffavourites such as Two Door Cinema
OL,20,FClub, Biffy Clyro, Wolf Alice and The
OL,21,FKooks.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G1/7
