PN,32302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F323A1785669497
OL,3,CKendal Calling festival kicks off with
OL,4,C40,000 people expected
OL,6,FEven the Scissor Sisters have made the
OL,7,Ftrip from New York City to Kendal for
OL,8,Fthe festival.
OL,10,FAlthough there is a chance of rain
OL,11,Fforecast for Saturday, the weather on
OL,12,Fthe event's opening day is sunny and
OL,13,Fwarm, and the early birds have already
OL,14,Fset up camp and are soaking up rays on
OL,15,Ftheir foldable chairs.
OL,17,FCampers are being told to 'leave
OL,18,Fnothing but memories' at the festival,
OL,19,Fand as such recycling and refuse
OL,20,Fpoints are situated across the around
OL,21,F2,000 acre site.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G2/7
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
