FL,324,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F323A1785669497
OL,3,CKendal Calling festival kicks off with
OL,4,C40,000 people expected
OL,6,FWho are these headlining acts?
OL,8,FOrganisers say Biffy Clyro will become
OL,9,Fone of the festival's "biggest ever
OL,10,Fheadliners".
OL,12,FThe Scottish rockers will take to the
OL,13,Fstage following the success of their
OL,14,Ftenth studio album, Futique, whch
OL,15,Fdebuted at number 1 in the UK.
OL,17,FIrish indie pop group Two Door Cinema
OL,18,FClub will perform their critically
OL,19,Facclaimed debut album Tourist History,
OL,20,Falongside fan favourites.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G3/7
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
