PN,32304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F323A1785669497
OL,3,CKendal Calling festival kicks off with
OL,4,C40,000 people expected
OL,6,FWolf Alice, who won the 2018 Mercury
OL,7,FMusic Prize with their second album,
OL,8,FVisions of a Life, will also join them
OL,9,Fat the top.
OL,11,FThe Kooks will bring the festival's
OL,12,Fopening night to a close, celebrating
OL,13,Ftwenty years of their debut album
OL,14,FInside In/Inside Out, which features
OL,15,Fanthems such as 'She Moves In Her Own
OL,16,FWay' and 'Naive'.
OL,26,@xD@Mxt
