PN,32305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F323A1785669497
OL,3,CKendal Calling festival kicks off with
OL,4,C40,000 people expected
OL,6,FOne hundred and twenty acts have been
OL,7,Fannounced in total - with other
OL,8,Fperformers including The Cribs,
OL,9,FScissor Sisters, Gabrielle, Groove
OL,10,FArmada, 'A Thousand Miles' icon
OL,11,FVannesa Carlton, The Vaccines, Jamie
OL,12,FWebster, The Lathums, The Snuts, The
OL,13,FLibertines, Doves - as well as some
OL,14,Fspecial guests.
OL,16,FOther environmental measures in place
OL,17,Fthis year include a ban on disposable
OL,18,Fcharcoal barbecues and camp fires, due
OL,19,Fto the dry ground of the Lowther Deer
OL,20,FPark.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G5/7
