PN,32306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F323A1785669497
OL,3,CKendal Calling festival kicks off with
OL,4,C40,000 people expected
OL,6,FKendal Calling organisers said that in
OL,7,Fthe deer park, "the grass (is) well
OL,8,Fand truly parched", adding, "some of
OL,9,Fthe grass looks closer to straw!",
OL,10,Ffollowing this summer's hot and dry
OL,11,Fweather.
OL,13,FBlowtorches, Chinese lanterns,
OL,14,Fcampfires and fireworks are also
OL,15,Fforbidden during the festival.
OL,17,FFestival goers will also be forced to
OL,18,Flimit the amount of beer and liquor
OL,19,Fthey bring to their camp, as alcohol
OL,20,Fcan only be brought from their cars on
OL,21,Ftheir first trip to the campsites.
